cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "DarwinTrade: Hierarchical Self-Evolution for Multi-Agent Portfolio Trading"
abstract: >-
  DarwinTrade is a multi-agent trading system that decomposes policy adaptation
  into three state-disjoint self-evolution loops (analyst reliability, expiring
  tactical guards, and trialed allocator patches) over a deterministic executor
  that the LLM never edits.
